{"seq":3,"slug":"deliverability","title":"邮件投递率优化","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-email-delivery/deliverability","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"reputation-warmup","title":"域名声誉与预热","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-email-delivery/deliverability/reputation-warmup","wordCount":1730,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"bounce-handling-hygiene","title":"退信处理与列表卫生","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-email-delivery/deliverability/bounce-handling-hygiene","wordCount":1731,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"inbox-placement-optimization","title":"收件箱投递优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-email-delivery/deliverability/inbox-placement-optimization","wordCount":1756,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"邮件投递率优化\">邮件投递率优化</h1><p>本章聚焦邮件能否真正进入收件箱——而非停留在垃圾箱或被直接拒收。域名/IP 声誉的建立与预热、退信的分类处理与列表清洗、收件箱投递策略（内容优化、发送频率、反馈循环），三个维度共同决定了系统的长期投递率。</p>\n"}